  rdfs:comment           "Imported from Reactome: https://reactome.org/content/detail/R-HSA-9717207" , "Provides Input For Rule. The relation 'GNAT3 exchanges GDP for GTP in L-Glu,L-Asp:GMP,IMP:TAS1R1:TAS1R3:GNAT3:GDP:GNB1,3:GNG13' 'null' 'L-Glu,L-Asp:GMP,IMP:TAS1R1:TAS1R3:GNAT3:GTP:GNB1,3:GNG13 dissociates yielding TAS1R1:TAS1R3:L-Glu,L-Asp:GMP,IMP and GNAT3:GTP, and GNB1,3:GNG13' was inferred because:\n reaction1 has an output that is an input of reaction 2. " ;
